Native engine app (experiments/native-engine/frontend): which controller drives the in-game menu, after melee-unlocked's
host/settings_nav.h (GPL-2.0-or-later): the menu follows the pad that last went from rest to active (the L + R + Start
pad when that opened it), so a drifting second pad cannot take the menu; after it closes the game reads neutral pads
until every button is up and the driving pad is at rest (one second at most). After patches/0104 and 0111. Applied to a
build-time copy only.
SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later

